/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (A senior capstone design project, I chose to develop a site for a fictional Battle of the Bands music festival that would take place in Mesa, AZ. I prototyped and coded three responisve pages for this site. I developed a general structure for the pages by designing wireframes in Figma, and developing a color and font system meant to reflect a punk, rock and roll tone. After taking feedback on the initial designs I developed prototypes that I then developed into an html5 website that displays info about the festival.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
