<<
/Title (Objectives and Process I worked with Momentum Innovation on developing their Educate Offsite platform. This is an online trade skills/education website funded by the U.S. Department of Energy Building Technologies Office. I worked closely with their communications director and web developer to design a web site front-end for both mobile and desktop platforms. We started from a flow chart of mock-ups for the pages the director was looking for, developing a smooth navigation experience for users. This project allowed me to further develop my experience with React development as well as deployment of web pages with AWS.)
